{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/时间回溯","pageid":8795,"revid":21860,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%9E%E6%BA%AF&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%9E%E6%BA%AF&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%9E%E6%BA%AF&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>时间回溯</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.97.B6.E9.97.B4.E5.9B.9E.E6.BA.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"时间回溯\"><b>时间回溯</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 时间回溯.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/5ojlw8fikvrg96i63se517w5svqf3vo.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%9E%E6%BA%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/5ojlw8fikvrg96i63se517w5svqf3vo.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%9B%9E%E6%BA%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3d/5ojlw8fikvrg96i63se517w5svqf3vo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />时间回溯\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-99\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓99-↑99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）需选择没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"归于虚空\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">归于虚空</font></span></span>]的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]释放，并使其受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"归于虚空\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">归于虚空</font></span></span>]。随后使自身位置、生命值、能量值及技能冷却时间复原至行动开始时。<br />✦释放技能后，受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时间回溯•锁定\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时间回溯•锁定</font></span></span>]，及获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"潜能激发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">潜能激发</font></span></span>]和<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层最大生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤害锁定\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">伤害锁定</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">菲娜塔</span>]自身释放时，额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]，并回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-99 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-99_0.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-99_0.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-99_0.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"202\" data-file-height=\"202\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\